WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:07.093
This is the course library: every assigned source in one place, with practice attached.

2
00:00:07.093 --> 00:00:13.518
Browse or filter to find a source. Filter by week or search by author, title, or idea.

3
00:00:13.518 --> 00:00:23.109
Open a source's detail page. It shows the full citation, where to access the reading, roughly how long it takes, and what the source argues.

4
00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:34.024
Use Source Practice on sources you have read. Each practised source gives you a few questions with explanations, so you know whether the reading actually landed.

5
00:00:34.025 --> 00:00:42.210
Save sources to your shelf. The saved shelf collects sources you want to come back to, for example for an assignment.

6
00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.107
Source Practice is never scored.

7
00:00:45.107 --> 00:00:51.351
Where next: Take two or three sources into Compare Sources and hold them side by side.
